@startuml HandleSetHgmExclusiveScreen_Sequence

skinparam monospace true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign direction
title 时序图

participant "APS" as App #LightBlue
participant "RSInterfaces" as Ifaces #White
participant "HgmContext" as Ctx #LightYellow
participant "HgmFrameRateManager" as FreqMgr #LightGreen
participant "HgmCore" as Core #White
participant "HgmScreen" as Screen #White

== 客户端侧 ==
App -> Ifaces : SetHgmExclusiveScreen(optional<ScreenId>)
activate Ifaces

note over Ifaces, Ctx
  中间层已折叠:
  - IPC: RSRenderServiceClient → Proxy (WriteInterfaceToken/WriteUint64, TF_SYNC)
    → Binder → Stub::OnRemoteRequest (ReadUint64) → RSClientToServiceConnection (携带 remotePid_ 作为 pid)
  - 线程投递: HgmContext 通过 HgmTaskHandleThread::ScheduleTask(...).wait()
    把任务同步投递到 Hgm 线程执行，IPC 线程在此阻塞
end note

Ifaces -> Ctx : SetHgmExclusiveScreen(pid, screenId.value_or(INVALID))
activate Ctx
Ctx -> FreqMgr : frameRateManager->HandleSetHgmExclusiveScreen(pid, screenId)
activate FreqMgr

== HandleSetHgmExclusiveScreen 函数体 ==
alt screenId != INVALID_SCREEN_ID
    FreqMgr -> Core : HgmCore::Instance().GetScreen(screenId)
    activate Core
    Core --> FreqMgr : sptr<HgmScreen> screen
    deactivate Core
    FreqMgr -> Screen : screen->GetSelfOwnedScreenFlag()
    activate Screen
    Screen --> FreqMgr : bool selfOwned
    deactivate Screen
    note right of FreqMgr
      若 !screen 或 !selfOwned
      则 return false (不写入 hgmExclusiveScreenId_)
    end note
    FreqMgr -> FreqMgr : cleanPidCallback_[pid].insert(HGM_EXCLUSIVE_SCREEN)
else screenId == INVALID_SCREEN_ID
    FreqMgr -> FreqMgr : cleanPidCallback_[pid].erase(HGM_EXCLUSIVE_SCREEN)
end
FreqMgr -> FreqMgr : hgmExclusiveScreenId_.store(screenId)
FreqMgr --> Ctx : return true
deactivate FreqMgr

== 结果回传 ==
Ctx --> Ifaces : return result
deactivate Ctx
Ifaces --> App : return bool
deactivate Ifaces

note over Screen, Core
  <b>后续消费 (非本接口调用链, 仅说明)</b>:
  HgmHardwareUtils::ApplyRefreshRate 在 RSHardwareThread
  通过 GetHgmExclusiveScreenId() 读取 hgmExclusiveScreenId_，
  当其有效且 screenId != exclusiveScreenId 时跳过该屏刷新率切换。
end note

@enduml
